      "content": "GREAT MISSENDEN        AYLESBURY ROAD SP 90 SE 1/3                                                  (west side)                                                      Barn at Road Farm GV                                                      II C18.  Timber-framed, weather-boarded.  Old tile roof with half hipped ends, and similar roofs to cart entries each side.  Lean-to addition on south side.  Five bays; tie beams with straight braces and curving struts supporting double purlin roof. Listing NGR: SP8851502832"
    }
